{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50769","headline":"和李子智鲁中使院前凿池种芦之什 · 张祜","name":"和李子智鲁中使院前凿池种芦之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鉴地栽芦贮碧流，临轩一望似汀洲。\n䓗笼好映淮南树，疎野偏直海上鸥。\n历历迎风欹枕晓，萧萧和雨卷帘秋。\n君看范蠡功成公然上道烟波无去舟。\n（见《全芳备祖後集》卷十二《芦》，缺题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}